{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"平\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"Y\",\n    \"small\": \"X\",\n    \"core\": \"平\",\n    \"concise\": \"X\",\n    \"human\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\",\n    \"load\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"big：Y把人物处境、原因和转折都放进完整的大块里，单看大字更容易理解每屏发生了什么；core：两版都持续呈现不愿再受委屈与怀念旧日亲近生活之间的拉扯，最后也都落到带着想念继续生活，主线没有明显高下。small：X的小字有更多不重复主线的补充角度，例如“外头像给众人看的舞步，心里却只哼自己的旧歌”“不是记忆变坏了，是它太好了”；concise：X较好，Y在S11、S12把大块已经说过的“万一能呢”、心软和怕孤单又在小字里重复了一遍。human：Y略好，X的“活动感像暂时侧身离开沉重的问题”“以完整、鲜明的姿态建立秩序”偏抽象书面，虽然Y的“心脏以最高负荷”也略显生硬；fine：Y的感受更持续地落在观众自身的身体和心理体验上，X有不少感受转而描写和弦、旋律及舞步本身；load：X较好，放大的重点词组明显少于Y逐屏累积的整句大块，尤其Y的S11四块大字只停留22秒，阅读压力偏大。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "c39df0f9-4702-4514-8c52-9d683676d3d2", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261111T005004340079Z", "elapsed_seconds": 289.328, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T00:54:53.678910+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c600a9d5409624debe921894540adcdb3999a093b813c0edf29f2b245f148797", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d98